<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25582" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lactĕus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		lac. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Of milk, milky; full of milk</i> (mostly <b>poet.</b>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">umor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					15, 79</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ubera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 2, 525</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> In
			partic., <i>milk-drinking, sucking</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vernae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. 3, 58, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">porcus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					3, 47, 12</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>milk-white,
				milkcolored, milky</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">colla,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 8, 660</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cervix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 10, 137</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gemma,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					8, 45, 2</span></i>
			: circulus, the Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαλαξίας
			κύκλος</span>, <i>the Milky Way</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Rep.
				6, 16, 16</span></i>; also, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">via,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					1, 168</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Illa
			Livi lactea ubertas, <i>pure</i>, <i><span class="en">Quint. 10,
				1, 32</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
